          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "Summary",
          "content": "The R package biospear allows selecting the biomarkers with the strongest impact on survival and on the treatment effect in high-dimensional Cox models, and estimating expected survival probabilities. Most of the implemented approaches are based on penalized regression techniques."
        },
        {
          "NlmCategory": "UNASSIGNED",
          "Label": "Availability and implementation",
          "content": "The package is available on the CRAN. (https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=biospear)."
